graphy_body-medium__PUvGv"><p>This new center at Stanford convenes scholars=
 from across the university to study the technical principles and societal =
impact of foundation models.</p></div></div><div class=3D"tier-scroll-check=
er"><div class=3D"ContainedStream_root__iTjeF Article_streamBlocks__KNROF">=
<div class=3D"containedStreamBlock"><div class=3D"RichText_root__rwW2s __va=
riable_3e54d8 __variable_665e44 __variable_d030ea __variable_85618c __varia=
